      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>An Introduction to the Forge of Legends. Your guide to the Arcanum's supermundane smelter. By Ignus Ferric. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_16.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>While it's unknown who built the Forge of Legends, it's construction shows techniques from multiple Worlds. Even different dimensions! </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_17.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>It's believed this uncommon design is what imbues the Forge with the unique ability to produce items of Legendary quality. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_18.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>That unrivaled composition also creates an operational paradox, in that it can only be operated by a Legendary Crafter. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_19.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>However, the only known way a Crafter can attain Legendary Crafting level is to use the Forge of Legends. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_20.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>Due to this conundrum, the Forge of Legends sat dormant for centuries. Then, after many years of frustrating study I had a revelation. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_21.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>Crafters where I come from have a saying: 'No matter the problem, one must always forge ahead.' </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_22.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>Therefore, to attain the skill required to use the Forge of Legends, one simply needs to use the Forge of Legends! </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_23.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>That said, to Craft anything of substance a Legendary Crafting Recipe is also required. So I hammered out a few of those too! </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_24.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Back so soon? Did you do your homework on the Forge of Legends? Smashing! Then you're ready to 'forge ahead' and become a Legendary Crafter!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_25.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Here, this Teleportation Tapestry Recipe will serve as a good start with the Forge of Legends. Then it'll help you return!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_26.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Once you've mastered that, I'll have more Legendary Crafting Recipes I can sell you. Well, go on then. Get to Smelting Room and get Crafting!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IgnusFerric_MIR_27.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340968,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
